<Activity mc:Ignorable="sap sap2010" x:Class="Workday_Test_Execution" this:Workday_Test_Execution.WorkdayUiTimeout="00:00:30" sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="Workday Test Execution template. Wraps a Workday hire test case at run time; the test case runs in place of the Placeholder.&#xA;Set up: log the start and check that the mock ATS answers.&#xA;On failure: log the reason, record a failed verification with a screenshot in the test results, mark the run Failed in Data Fabric when in_RunId was passed, then rethrow so the test still fails.&#xA;After the test, pass or fail: stop a proxy the test left active and log the elapsed time (done in the Catch before the rethrow, because a Finally block does not run when the error fails the job).&#xA;The test case keeps every step that decides pass or fail; this template holds only what happens around it." xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/netfx/2009/xaml/activities" xmlns:mc="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006" xmlns:s="clr-namespace:System;assembly=System.Private.CoreLib" xmlns:sap="http://schemas.microsoft.com/netfx/2009/xaml/activities/presentation" xmlns:sap2010="http://schemas.microsoft.com/netfx/2010/xaml/activities/presentation" xmlns:scg="clr-namespace:System.Collections.Generic;assembly=System.Private.CoreLib" xmlns:sco="clr-namespace:System.Collections.ObjectModel;assembly=System.Private.CoreLib" xmlns:t="clr-namespace:Testing_Workday_CrossPlatform;assembly=DataService.Testing_Workday_CrossPlatform" xmlns:this="clr-namespace:" xmlns:ui="http://schemas.uipath.com/workflow/activities" xmlns:uix="http://schemas.uipath.com/workflow/activities/uix" xmlns:uta="clr-namespace:UiPath.Testing.Activities;assembly=UiPath.Testing.Activities" xmlns:uwah="clr-namespace:UiPath.Web.Activities.Http;assembly=UiPath.Web.Activities" xmlns:uwahm="clr-namespace:UiPath.Web.Activities.Http.Models;assembly=UiPath.Web.Activities" xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">
  <x:Members>
